  <releases>
    <release version="2.0.0" date="2026-11-18">
      <description>
        <p>New features and reliability improvements:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>InputPlumber virtual controller detection, profile details, and source device inspection</li>
          <li>DualSense speaker test over PipeWire</li>
          <li>Redrawn symbolic controller icons rendered through GSK</li>
          <li>Hardware info dialogs can be closed while a read is in progress</li>
          <li>More robust device reconnection and hardware matching</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Version 2.0 requires GTK 4.16 and libadwaita 1.7 or newer.</p>
      </description>
    </release>
